---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy" noindex>
  <article class="legal">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal · Draft for review</span><h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-notice">The staging site does not intentionally activate marketing analytics. This policy must be updated when the final analytics, advertising and consent tools are selected.</p>
    <h2>Essential technologies</h2><p>Essential storage may be used to operate security, preferences or core website functions.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2><p>If analytics are enabled, non-essential measurement should follow the final consent configuration and identify the provider, purpose and retention period.</p>
    <h2>Advertising</h2><p>Advertising pixels or remarketing technologies should not load before the required consent choice is recorded.</p>
    <h2>Managing preferences</h2><p>The public site should provide a clear way to accept, reject or revise non-essential cookie preferences.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
